ruleBookInfo.intro:
书籍信息：
编号：@get:{bookid}
出版社：{{@@tr:nth-child(1) > td:nth-child(2) > div@text}}
小说系列：{{@@tr:nth-child(1) > td:nth-child(4)@text}}
系列：{{@@tr:nth-child(2) > td:nth-child(2) > div@text}}
男主角：{{@@tr:nth-child(2) > td:nth-child(4) > div@text}}
女主角：{{@@tr:nth-child(3) > td:nth-child(4)@text}}
其他人物：{{@@tr:nth-child(4) > td:nth-child(4)@text}}
出版日期：{{@@table:nth-child(2) tr:nth-child(3) > td:nth-child(2)@text}}
制作网站：{{@@table:nth-child(2) tr:nth-child(4) > td:nth-child(2)@text}}
情节分类：{{@@table:nth-child(2) tr:nth-child(5) > td:nth-child(2)@text}}
故事地点：{{@@tr:nth-child(5) > td:nth-child(4)@text}}
时代背景：{{@@tr:nth-child(6) > td:nth-child(4)@text}}
推荐指数：{{@@tr:nth-child(6) > td:nth-child(2) > img@src##.*?level(\d+).*##$1}}
简介：
{{@@table:nth-child(8) tr:nth-child(3) > td:nth-child(2)@html}}

